# A2/A2.1/A2_11_daily_routine_and_reflexives.letz
# Source: PDF slide decks "L9 (Part 1) a21lotsmanmeli.pdf" and
# "L9 (Deel 2) a21lotsmanmeli.pdf" (A2.11 Daily Routine & Reflexives).
# Lemmas and noun gender were verified with LOD. A1 routine vocabulary is not
# repeated as new Elements; it returns only in sentence and fill contexts.
# Grammar focus: subject-matched reflexive pronouns; time prepositions versus
# adverbs; separable verbs in main clauses; frequency adverbs and inversion.

@lesson A2.11 "Daily Routine & Reflexives"

# --- Reflexive routines ---
@word d'Gewunnecht = the habit
@word de Wecker = the alarm clock
@word sech wäschen = to wash oneself
@word sech kämmen = to comb one's hair
@word sech raséieren = to shave
@word sech schminken = to put on make-up
@word sech verspéiden = to be late
@word sech këmmeren ëm = to take care of
@word sech trennen vun = to separate from
@word sech verléiwen an = to fall in love with
@word sech gutt verstoen mat = to get on well with

# --- Reflexive pronouns agree with the subject ---
@sentence
@lu Ech wäsche mech moies.
@en I wash myself in the morning.
@distractor-en yourself
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu dech
@distractor-lu owes

@sentence
@lu Du wäsch dech owes.
@en You wash yourself in the evening.
@distractor-en myself
@distractor-en morning
@distractor-lu mech
@distractor-lu moies

@sentence
@lu Hie kämmt sech virum Spigel.
@en He combs his hair in front of the mirror.
@distractor-en washes
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu wäscht
@distractor-lu owes

@sentence
@lu Mir treffen eis nom Cours.
@en We meet after class.
@distractor-en work
@distractor-en before
@distractor-lu Aarbecht
@distractor-lu virun

@sentence
@lu Dir verspéit iech oft.
@en You are often late.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en early
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu fréi

@sentence
@lu Si schminke sech moies.
@en They put on make-up in the morning.
@distractor-en shave
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu raséieren
@distractor-lu owes

@sentence
@lu Ech raséiere mech virum Schlofegoen.
@en I shave before going to sleep.
@distractor-en after
@distractor-en wash
@distractor-lu no
@distractor-lu wäschen

@sentence
@lu Du këmmers dech ëm d'Kanner.
@en You take care of the children.
@distractor-en meet
@distractor-en parents
@distractor-lu treffs
@distractor-lu Elteren

@sentence
@lu Hie trennt sech vu senger Fra.
@en He separates from his wife.
@distractor-en loves
@distractor-en mother
@distractor-lu verléift
@distractor-lu Mamm

@sentence
@lu Mir verstinn eis gutt.
@en We get on well.
@distractor-en badly
@distractor-en late
@distractor-lu schlecht
@distractor-lu spéit

@sentence
@lu Dir verléift iech séier.
@en You fall in love quickly.
@distractor-en slowly
@distractor-en separate
@distractor-lu lues
@distractor-lu trennt

@sentence
@lu Si bestueden sech am Summer.
@en They get married in the summer.
@distractor-en meet
@distractor-en winter
@distractor-lu treffen
@distractor-lu Wanter

# --- Separable verbs: prefix at the end of a main clause ---
@sentence
@lu Ech stinn um siwen Auer op.
@en I get up at seven o'clock.
@distractor-en sleep
@distractor-en eight
@distractor-lu schlofen
@distractor-lu aacht

@sentence
@lu Du stees moies dacks op.
@en You often get up in the morning.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu owes

@sentence
@lu Hie steet normalerweis fréi op.
@en He normally gets up early.
@distractor-en late
@distractor-en rarely
@distractor-lu spéit
@distractor-lu seelen

@sentence
@lu Mir stinn samschdes spéit op.
@en We get up late on Saturdays.
@distractor-en early
@distractor-en Sundays
@distractor-lu fréi
@distractor-lu sonndes

@sentence
@lu Dir stitt sonndes ni fréi op.
@en You never get up early on Sundays.
@distractor-en always
@distractor-en Saturdays
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@distractor-lu samschdes

@sentence
@lu Si stinn all Dag um sechs Auer op.
@en They get up at six o'clock every day.
@distractor-en seven
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu siwen
@distractor-lu owes

@sentence
@lu Ech doen mech séier un.
@en I get dressed quickly.
@distractor-en slowly
@distractor-en shave
@distractor-lu lues
@distractor-lu raséieren

@sentence
@lu Du dees dech ëmmer un.
@en You always get dressed.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en wash
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu wäschen

@sentence
@lu Hie deet sech nom Duschen un.
@en He gets dressed after showering.
@distractor-en before
@distractor-en sleeping
@distractor-lu virum
@distractor-lu Schlofegoen

@sentence
@lu Mir dinn eis virum Concert un.
@en We get dressed before the concert.
@distractor-en after
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-lu no
@distractor-lu Kino

@sentence
@lu Dir ditt iech ni séier un.
@en You never get dressed quickly.
@distractor-en always
@distractor-en slowly
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@distractor-lu lues

@sentence
@lu Si dinn sech nom Kaffi un.
@en They get dressed after breakfast.
@distractor-en before
@distractor-en lunch
@distractor-lu virum
@distractor-lu Mëttegiessen

# --- Time prepositions and adverbs ---
@sentence
@lu Nom Opstoen wäschen ech mech.
@en After getting up, I wash myself.
@distractor-en before
@distractor-en shave
@distractor-lu virum
@distractor-lu raséieren

@sentence
@lu No der Aarbecht treffen ech mech mat Frënn.
@en After work, I meet friends.
@distractor-en before
@distractor-en family
@distractor-lu virun
@distractor-lu Famill

@sentence
@lu Virun der Aarbecht kämmen ech mech.
@en Before work, I comb my hair.
@distractor-en after
@distractor-en shave
@distractor-lu no
@distractor-lu raséieren

@sentence
@lu Virum Schlofegoen liesen ech e Buch.
@en Before going to sleep, I read a book.
@distractor-en after
@distractor-en television
@distractor-lu no
@distractor-lu Tëlee

@sentence
@lu Duerno dinn ech mech un.
@en Afterwards I get dressed.
@distractor-en before
@distractor-en wash
@distractor-lu virdrun
@distractor-lu wäschen

@sentence
@lu Virdrun drénken ech Kaffi.
@en Before that, I drink coffee.
@distractor-en afterwards
@distractor-en dinner
@distractor-lu duerno
@distractor-lu Owesiessen

@sentence
@lu Um zwielef Auer maache mir eng Mëttespaus.
@en At twelve o'clock we take a lunch break.
@distractor-en seven
@distractor-en breakfast
@distractor-lu siwen
@distractor-lu Kaffi

@sentence
@lu Ech kommen um fënnef Auer heem.
@en I come home at five o'clock.
@distractor-en six
@distractor-en work
@distractor-lu sechs
@distractor-lu Aarbecht

# --- Frequency adverbs and inversion ---
@sentence
@lu Ëmmer moies wäschen ech mech.
@en Every morning I wash myself.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu owes

@sentence
@lu Normalerweis stinn ech um siwen Auer op.
@en Normally I get up at seven o'clock.
@distractor-en rarely
@distractor-en eight
@distractor-lu seelen
@distractor-lu aacht

@sentence
@lu Meeschtens treffen mir eis no der Aarbecht.
@en Mostly we meet after work.
@distractor-en before
@distractor-en family
@distractor-lu virun
@distractor-lu Famill

@sentence
@lu Oft verspéit hien sech moies.
@en He is often late in the morning.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu owes

@sentence
@lu Heiansdo kämmt si sech owes.
@en Sometimes she combs her hair in the evening.
@distractor-en always
@distractor-en morning
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@distractor-lu moies

@sentence
@lu Seelen raséiere mir eis virum Schlofegoen.
@en We rarely shave before going to sleep.
@distractor-en always
@distractor-en after
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@distractor-lu no

@sentence
@lu Ni verspéide mir eis virum Concert.
@en We are never late before the concert.
@distractor-en often
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-lu oft
@distractor-lu Kino

@sentence
@lu Gewéinlech kucke si owes Tëlee.
@en They usually watch television in the evening.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en morning
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu moies

# --- Direct and indirect object pronouns ---
@sentence
@lu Ech maachen dir eng Schmier.
@en I make you a slice of bread.
@distractor-en me
@distractor-en coffee
@distractor-lu mech
@distractor-lu Kaffi

@sentence
@lu Mir gesinn dech no der Aarbecht.
@en We see you after work.
@distractor-en them
@distractor-en before
@distractor-lu si
@distractor-lu virun

@sentence
@lu Hien gesäit eis virum Concert.
@en He sees us before the concert.
@distractor-en you
@distractor-en after
@distractor-lu iech
@distractor-lu no

@sentence
@lu Dir hutt mech moies gesinn.
@en You saw me in the morning.
@distractor-en them
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu si
@distractor-lu owes

@sentence
@lu Si gesinn hien duerno.
@en They see him afterwards.
@distractor-en her
@distractor-en before
@distractor-lu hatt
@distractor-lu virdrun

# --- @fill: reflexive pronouns -----------------------------------------------
# Wrong-person reflexives are deliberate distractors: the pronoun must agree
# with the subject, not merely look like a familiar reflexive form.

@fill
@lu Ech wäsche [mech] virum Kaffi.
@en I wash [myself] before breakfast.
@distractor-lu dech
@distractor-lu sech
@distractor-lu eis
@distractor-en yourself
@distractor-en himself
@distractor-en ourselves

@fill
@lu Du käms [dech] virum Spigel.
@en You comb [yourself] in front of the mirror.
@distractor-lu mech
@distractor-lu sech
@distractor-lu iech
@distractor-en myself
@distractor-en herself
@distractor-en ourselves

@fill
@lu Hie raséiert [sech] owes.
@en He shaves [himself] in the evening.
@distractor-lu mech
@distractor-lu dech
@distractor-lu eis
@distractor-en myself
@distractor-en yourself
@distractor-en ourselves

@fill
@lu Ech a meng Schwëster hu [eis] nom Cours getraff.
@en My sister and I met [each other] after class.
@distractor-lu mech
@distractor-lu dech
@distractor-lu sech
@distractor-en myself
@distractor-en yourself
@distractor-en himself

@fill
@lu Dir verspéit [iech] all Mueren.
@en You are late [yourselves] every morning.
@distractor-lu mech
@distractor-lu dech
@distractor-lu sech
@distractor-en myself
@distractor-en himself
@distractor-en ourselves

@fill
@lu Hatt schminkt [sech] moies.
@en She puts on make-up [herself] in the morning.
@distractor-lu mech
@distractor-lu dech
@distractor-lu iech
@distractor-en myself
@distractor-en yourself
@distractor-en ourselves

